    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Sobia Haseeb*, 21, suffers from rheumatoid arthritis, a chronic disease that causes pain, swelling and stiffness in her joints. Sobia needs a range of expensive medicines to manage her condition and meeting the cost of her treatment is a persistent challenge.",
